cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CGE-Core, please cite it as below, and additionally cite the
  original PyCGE (Fung & Burtwistle, NIST) and the Hosoe, Gasawa & Hashimoto
  (2010) textbook whose model it implements. See README.md ("Provenance and
  license") for the BibTeX entries.
title: "CGE-Core: a Pyomo-based computable general equilibrium framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Miraflor
    given-names: James Matthew
    email: james.miraflor@gmail.com
version: 0.3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/miraflor/CGE-core"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - cge
  - computable-general-equilibrium
  - pyomo
  - economics
  - policy-simulation
notes: >-
  CGE-Core is a corrected and annotated fork of PyCGE by Juan Fung and
  Charley Burtwistle (U.S. National Institute of Standards and Technology,
  2017; public domain under 17 U.S.C. 105). The underlying model port is not
  the fork maintainer's original work. The fork's revisions were produced
  through an AI-assisted ("vibecoded") workflow directed and reviewed by
  James Matthew Miraflor. The model equations were checked line-by-line
  against the GAMS Model Library reference implementations (splcge.gms
  SEQ=275, stdcge.gms SEQ=276); the bundled regression suite validates the
  numerical benchmarks and engine workflow behaviour.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "PyCGE: A Python Interface for Solving CGE Models"
    authors:
      - family-names: Fung
        given-names: Juan
      - family-names: Burtwistle
        given-names: Charley
    year: 2017
    url: "https://github.com/juanfung/pycge"
    institution:
      name: "National Institute of Standards and Technology"
  - type: book
    title: >-
      Textbook of Computable General Equilibrium Modelling: Programming and
      Simulations
    authors:
      - family-names: Hosoe
        given-names: Nobuhiro
      - family-names: Gasawa
        given-names: Kenji
      - family-names: Hashimoto
        given-names: Hideo
    year: 2010
    publisher:
      name: "Palgrave Macmillan"
    doi: "10.1057/9780230281653"
